# Sound masters are never committed (SERIES.md section 2). They reach the render PC as a packed,
# SHA-256-checked download: pc/pack-sound.mjs + delivery.json + pc/build-caches.mjs (pc/MANIFEST.md, "Sound").
# Only delivery.json, README.md and the subtitle file S01E01.en.srt belong in git here.
*.wav
*.flac
*.aiff
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.aac
*.ogg
*.opus
*.tar
*.part
*.part-dk
# sound/mix.mjs: draft-cut mixes (mix.wav, the muxed .mp4 copy, a .srt copy, mix-report.json) and its work files.
# The committed copy of each report is sound/reports/<cut>.json.
cuts/
.work/
*.mp4
